\description{
Fits the model in two stages (modular inference): the choice module, with
the latent positions, from the choice of receivers alone
(\code{\link[=lsdynam_choice_stage]{lsdynam_choice_stage()}}), and then the rate module given summaries of the
positions (\code{\link[=lsdynam_rate_stage]{lsdynam_rate_stage()}}).
